@startuml 05-Login
title Luồng 5: Đăng nhập

actor "Khách" as G5
participant "Modal\nĐăng nhập" as Modal5
participant "auth.js" as AuthJS5
participant "Flask\n(auth.py)" as Flask5
participant "DB\n(SQLAlchemy)" as DB5

G5 -> Modal5: Điền form đăng nhập\n(email/username, password)
G5 -> Modal5: Bấm "Đăng nhập"

Modal5 -> AuthJS5: submit event → fetch()
AuthJS5 -> Flask5: POST /auth/login\n{ identifier, password, remember }

Flask5 -> DB5: User.query.filter_by(email=...).first()
DB5 --> Flask5: None

Flask5 -> DB5: User.query.filter_by(username=...).first()
DB5 --> Flask5: User object

Flask5 -> Flask5: user.check_password(password) → True
Flask5 -> Flask5: login_user(user, remember=remember)

Flask5 --> AuthJS5: JSON { success: true, redirect: '/' }
AuthJS5 -> AuthJS5: window.location.href = '/'

note over G5: Header chuyển từ guest-header\nsang user-header (có notification bell)

@enduml